\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Pipeline overview. A single RGB image is processed by a unified YOLO26x backbone to produce a metric depth map and a Cityscapes semantic segmentation map. Foreground-aware depth normalization and luminance modulation yield a composite density field, which drives a three-layer Weighted Voronoi stippling architecture (fine, depth-emphasis, edge/background) with cross-layer overlap pruning. Semantic-aware rendering assigns distinct dot colors to foreground and background within a shared palette.}}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{3}{Pipeline overview. A single RGB image is processed by a unified YOLO26x backbone to produce a metric depth map and a Cityscapes semantic segmentation map. Foreground-aware depth normalization and luminance modulation yield a composite density field, which drives a three-layer Weighted Voronoi stippling architecture (fine, depth-emphasis, edge/background) with cross-layer overlap pruning. Semantic-aware rendering assigns distinct dot colors to foreground and background within a shared palette}{figure.caption.1}{}}
